agement and Information System, Directorate of Institutional Finance, Directorate of Local Fund and Audit and Directorate of Pension Provident Fund and Insurance.\nThree Corporation/Company/Board also works under Finance Department of GoMP i.e. Madhya…\n\n READ MORE\nEVENTS\n27 APR 2022\n\nNPS Notice Board\n\nVIEW MORE\nNPS LINKS\n\nOnline PRAN Generation Process\n\nList of PRAN pending to initiate the Exit Case after retirement\n\nList of PRANs pending for Annuity Purchase\n\nFormat for Deactivation of Multiple/Duplicate PRAN\n\nFormat for DDO Registration/Updation/Re-mapping\n\nVIEW MORE\nIMPORTANT LINKS\nDirectorate Treasury and Accounts\nhttps://www.mptreasury.org/\nFinance Department M P\nhttp://www.finance.mp.gov.in/\nAGMP Gwalior\nhttp://www.agmp.nic.in/\nPension Fund Regulatory and Development Authority\nhttp://www.pfrda.org.in/\nNational Security Depository Limited\nhttps://npscra.nsdl.co.in/\nVIEW MORE\n QUICK LINKS\n\nEmployee Database Form\n\nC R Format for Clerical Cadre\n\nC R Format for Executive Cadre\n\nReady Reckoner for GIS 1985\n\nReady Reckoner for GIS 2003\n\nVIEW MORE\nFeedback\nWim\nTenders\nHyperlink Policy\nTerms and Conditions\nPrivacy Policy\nDisclaimer\nSite Map\nPhoto Gallery\nWebsite Policy\nHelp\n  Last Updated : 18, Oct 2026\n\n  \n\nContent Provided and Maintained by DoPPFI\nCopyright © 2026, Gov. of MP. All Rights Reserved.\nDesigned & developed by Center of Excellence (CoE) MPSeDC\n📅DIARY/CALENDAR 2026 \n2026\nDiary/calendar 2026",
